#: scenario3:scenario3_C36D05BF_1019_4FD0_A1BE_592FC25DA236
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6fd01ba7abd42e5e0fda37126c24def24a3d598bc0cc4f1e4dd111c84356d351
#. default-sha256: ed0ff1f7c4e4a5f17ac4a4d5035538a37fd852251f9084b181ba24056917f937
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_C36D05BF_1019_4FD0_A1BE_592FC25DA236"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫How... ⟪k:1⟫How did things end up this way?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫どうして……、⟪k:1⟫こんなことに、⟪k:2⟫なってしまうの……。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_B160FB80_A524_4386_B4F3_E09D32BB5AD9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4eb50483fa5a573cbd393e818aedc7b1f36d8d1292a04b77f83b51283c2eade8
#. default-sha256: 6c60233c346f7c8ffde023bf22c965f4ca5ff65304cde3d50b3b919bdd5bd6a5
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_B160FB80_A524_4386_B4F3_E09D32BB5AD9"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Why?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……どうして……？"

#: scenario3:scenario3_72DD4588_D919_4D40_BBCF_10DF9071DC19
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 90d241dbfdc742cbf064e181067c51ab31cdee28acfeda5d4c5809617bac042f
#. default-sha256: 2e7319b931a2fc64fc7b46ba6ef031ec74c2f2502baf642b326a4e1217395e6d
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_72DD4588_D919_4D40_BBCF_10DF9071DC19"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫All I wanted... ⟪k:1⟫was to go back to the way things used to be..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫私はただ、⟪k:1⟫前のように……戻りたかっただけなのに……。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_01DC8432_29AC_498E_8127_F1AD66CE1DDB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6570127cf91c0623c4b1b5864e51bc88304625e355f7da81f8c522ab85de6202
#. default-sha256: 826d7cd22ddb28d09b14a39abcfeee78b335bf9576739aa572e73d47e2ee3751
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_01DC8432_29AC_498E_8127_F1AD66CE1DDB"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫for us... ⟪k:1⟫to be able to smile around each other..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫笑い合えるように……なりたかっただけなのに……。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_25F5F851_BFB4_432D_AA33_50BD5DFE8B65
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b16a5fdb083f2b979767298ae78933dd4b1a03c6c7fdf3d3688062c533f35dbd
#. default-sha256: d14aa853c12b5aacaf1d5083c8e982a907f0e1721ffdcb7f98e0ecaf1b0d2c85
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_25F5F851_BFB4_432D_AA33_50BD5DFE8B65"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫It had been several days since Jacopo had locked her in the shed,⟪k:5⟫"
"and her day-to-day life was only growing more arduous."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫それから数日が過ぎましたが――、⟪k:5⟫彼女の生活はますます辛いものとなりまし"
"た。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_76ED8843_768C_428F_BF16_59040FFF0399
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b4d868b752293d58e4de0a2c226b257df8daf509afae9cc1340cc31a7d6f7e2b
#. default-sha256: c735aab92f5a423c76cec88ca7441f8b45712d22d23eee5cf4248917e1ab545f
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_76ED8843_768C_428F_BF16_59040FFF0399"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫She was under constant surveillance."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫ヤコポが言った通り、⟪k:1⟫彼女には監視がつきました。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_D63AC5CD_BE9C_4C09_8D08_7FF9D24AC514
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e1d54604e6e412c150df6418d22e947fdcd45814905ae44007b6ee3b73d0fad1
#. default-sha256: 1ab2cf83f9ce57c9d2a823489f7aa0b02fc7d1bf06b6c1807ff7848f11c83372
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_D63AC5CD_BE9C_4C09_8D08_7FF9D24AC514"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The door was only unlocked to deliver her meals, three times a day."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫小屋に掛かった鍵が開けられるのは、⟪k:1⟫一日三度の食事の時間のみ。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_5E0ECD43_A9F7_47DE_B584_A98423B18D9E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7f1320a5a6556cc2de9822e22823565514c8ec1d40e758fc6b5862df02094308
#. default-sha256: da2829d8736486ae2ae18b8f0ca318729da9f062b78f7f2cca83c3710232fbc7
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_5E0ECD43_A9F7_47DE_B584_A98423B18D9E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And despite what an unfortunate situation their employer’s wife found herself in, the maids "
"chattered and gossiped and giggled freely."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫そんな不憫な境遇であるというのに、⟪k:1⟫メイドたちは噂話に花を咲かせて、⟪k:2⟫くすくすと笑うの"
"です。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_ABAB1144_F8DD_44EA_ADD4_9EA3ED993684
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 394ab5eb0c27ebaf7b880b077f1b56fe2550f9bcd805bbd78e62ab8b64fa6a8d
#. default-sha256: eef2346d0c0b7561f6d1c4bb57c9ee9784764da6fd236ceec6141954b2e2b225
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_ABAB1144_F8DD_44EA_ADD4_9EA3ED993684"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Not even in the shadows, out of her presence—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫the tactless young maidservants "
"whispered directly to the White-Haired Girl when they brought her meals."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫見えないところでそうされるならまだしも……、⟪k:1⟫性質の悪いメイドなどは、⟪k:2⟫食事を運んできた"
"際に直接囁くのです。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_9D6D222B_02A2_461F_8BBA_9C81BD4803FD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7f5f580051a0fe69a0e7c65de13b53884f61ca28e7a0c8854074e8b8b75fc148
#. default-sha256: 687dc6f55be43867fa8c7fde856e6bf662eaffebdd192b3e0b7b4c709119107b
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_9D6D222B_02A2_461F_8BBA_9C81BD4803FD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫“Look at you, Madam. Caged away like cattle.”"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫「奥様ったら、これじゃまるで家畜か何かですよお」"

#: scenario3:scenario3_0236D815_8CAC_4C3B_B583_610E835AA4EA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 430ab83125a9e60f54107f8c82bcd5f65890232841241bea62b4ffaa53b47442
#. default-sha256: 25b2a9f4920b8f224ec19c0e804cb29c0178563a9c686d7acc3dff4e584c5f6d
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_0236D815_8CAC_4C3B_B583_610E835AA4EA"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I could almost hear the sound of cracks forming in her heart."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……彼女の心が罅割れていくような、⟪k:1⟫そんな音を――わたくしは聞いた気がいたしました。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_2BCE54D9_DEE5_487E_90CA_9A57CB8DF929
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 517d4fad2a5da5d8b8ca1b74316dbd525bc48f6a358b15553a018f30d73f1535
#. default-sha256: ce68ce8bc647d7762c1b07f82a36e43c858b26544f5353af909dadd88bb9b460
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_2BCE54D9_DEE5_487E_90CA_9A57CB8DF929"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I imagine she had gotten to the point where she was having difficulty merely holding herself "
"together. ⟪k:1⟫She had done nothing wrong, and yet she was forced to live this life of insults "
"and mockery."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫もはや自分を保つのも、⟪k:1⟫苦しいほどだったと想像できます。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫彼女は何も悪くないのに、"
"⟪k:4⟫罵られて、⟪k:5⟫こんな生活を強いられて。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_078106BF_26F7_4D9F_B146_205839DB0BD6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6b1d3bd5b5feb744d2e21430d41b3be7d9e273a66d0753435d237501fa07fe7e
#. default-sha256: 6694c18954453787358f7287c995254029b7a8d7b1031367f0b84383dc92138e
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_078106BF_26F7_4D9F_B146_205839DB0BD6"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Of ridicule."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫他人からは笑われて―――。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_EB2B0C5C_A288_4438_A0BD_8185567DD586
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: de5f7770c47ba1c787e42d532a7b0672eec2737ccb213f9399c769eb3e549180
#. default-sha256: a377cdd4b604e2830a7dc21c129885ce7e80cf4876bf84950527c671b3510c5a
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_EB2B0C5C_A288_4438_A0BD_8185567DD586"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The only reason her tenuously held together spirit did not completely shatter was because "
"she still had her one and only ally."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫それでも、⟪k:1⟫危うい精神が完全に壊れなかったのは、⟪k:2⟫やはり、⟪k:3⟫唯一の味方がいたからで"
"す。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_C0D14612_A806_49A7_AD7A_AB2A57C74595
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ae5ddfdf46c7e008bd66c3faf8825954c0458a4be91e40c0a6c27c06052698a6
#. default-sha256: a39e114f04ee9ec979bb232be94f9bb584c6ed4f4ba63f18f6cb9e249b8f1b83
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_C0D14612_A806_49A7_AD7A_AB2A57C74595"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The maid Maria volunteered to attend to the White-Haired Girl."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫メイドのマリーアは、⟪k:1⟫彼女の世話役をかって出ました。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_7211AC07_1F5C_4E7B_AA4D_1E09E86C26C4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 91d115a2032d98a0291888539ef2adbd0c6d072f80b4067d46f15bcb768596a2
#. default-sha256: 323d6c10a0dc8a194f59c3f709846cf64cf4acd88326f3f36074a74bc8562db2
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_7211AC07_1F5C_4E7B_AA4D_1E09E86C26C4"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Maria took over the duty of delivering her three meals, meaning the other maids stopped "
"coming by."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫三度の食事はマリーアだけが運ぶようになり、⟪k:1⟫他のメイドは近づけなくなりましたが――"

#: scenario3:scenario3_712172B1_5B9F_4386_BF8A_59BC684D38C0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 11f9779ca699cc3bed466d881c8c03131cd14f0d12f907172bc8b67d677dffc3
#. default-sha256: 782c604485da6764a5aca0a710d84876984bbf1e4c2af9715a139f2255664cb4
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_712172B1_5B9F_4386_BF8A_59BC684D38C0"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And that relieved the White-Haired Girl’s mental and emotional stress considerably."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫その方が、⟪k:1⟫白い髪の娘の精神的にも、⟪k:2⟫断然救われる話でございましたわ。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_014F5C94_F506_45A2_B7F9_BEEA11F15129
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: db93acc01628ae9cc0d0cb34e1fb47469434d606043558cf8b3992e0e8b6f203
#. default-sha256: 43b14cf2cdced3f839158cbb8f7d35ab7035f1c5b8fcdb8f2d5fc3e2adcefae9
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_014F5C94_F506_45A2_B7F9_BEEA11F15129"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Maria became her sole conversation partner, her sole companion.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫She did not leave "
"as soon as meals were finished, instead remaining in the shed with the White-Haired Girl for some "
"time."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫マリーアは、⟪k:1⟫彼女の唯一の話し相手として、⟪k:2⟫共に時を過ごすようになっていきます。⟪k:3⟫彼"
"女の食事が終わっても、⟪k:4⟫すぐには戻らずに……。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_BCFD5ACC_E8B5_4165_9D19_82B98BCB3AEE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1fc0325f7dbe97f2f14ecb8a27e5ebec25e8193b92fcabc175351a3fc420b04f
#. default-sha256: f9de8053e2a2014787f04ce5f426adc838f73912bef29b4e13952e6014ab2227
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_BCFD5ACC_E8B5_4165_9D19_82B98BCB3AEE"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫…………。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_7A20BE66_CFB9_4A5D_B338_4CA03B9BF20A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 170362638609509945ce375be2a595cfe51023c51ea795b844bcc54cb7da2ce9
#. default-sha256: d570a87ac64e27792617c330700d19bc580c3aa6d1be9206c4e9ce93bf46452a
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_7A20BE66_CFB9_4A5D_B338_4CA03B9BF20A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫…………。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_DFC320FD_FEA3_41B0_B8D1_0270A68407BD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c07788913670ae3a87ab595bbe7dbcd985181146a585cc16a15cf3fec233f42d
#. default-sha256: ddd6eb82e0af2bbb1ba88b208f3ad0a7b55976f8a33c1c4dc7f491b5b83af4fb
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_DFC320FD_FEA3_41B0_B8D1_0270A68407BD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫S-⟪k:2⟫So, ⟪k:3⟫uh, ⟪k:4⟫Madam, how ’bout a funny story?⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫I flubbed up pretty "
"hard the other day. You wanna hear about that?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫あ、⟪k:2⟫あのさ、⟪k:3⟫奥さま。⟪k:4⟫なんか楽しい話しようか！　⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫この前、⟪k:7⟫あた"
"しが仕事でぽかしちゃった話とか、⟪k:8⟫どう？"

#: scenario3:scenario3_378947F8_2A37_4B64_B4E0_BB55B07C4C94
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 170362638609509945ce375be2a595cfe51023c51ea795b844bcc54cb7da2ce9
#. default-sha256: d570a87ac64e27792617c330700d19bc580c3aa6d1be9206c4e9ce93bf46452a
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_378947F8_2A37_4B64_B4E0_BB55B07C4C94"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫…………。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_69824517_24CF_4B8E_B072_5694C0E5E948
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 20e461bc2af96c29d7e119232a290a74fe6ffa19b9d673b1db00a6849d6e678b
#. default-sha256: 0a7065a7b91443855ae0a88e27023c19e2a9bfe3d2357bd082c14e69d3cb36e0
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_69824517_24CF_4B8E_B072_5694C0E5E948"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫So a couple days back, I didn’t get enough sleep the previous night, right? ⟪k:2⟫I’m "
"helping out in the kitchen, half-awake, plating up some food,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫この前は寝不足でさ、⟪k:2⟫ぼんやりしながら食堂の手伝いをしてたわけ。⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫盛り付けな"
"んかをやってたんだけど――"

#: scenario3:scenario3_9E019DB4_7BCC_4D2A_862D_33920693D3EF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1513c841fece9780af62b1bac16ba5db0851a6b98fc2e704195a74cdb8b8d5a7
